List remote versiosn available for install

Usage: jabba ls-remote [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --arch <ARCH>      Architecture [default: amd64] [possible values: amd64, 386]
      --latest <LATEST>  Part of the version to trim to [possible values: major, minor, patch]
      --os <OS>          Operating System [default: linux] [possible values: darwin, linux, windows]
  -h, --help             Print help
